# esbuild - no entries needed. The override in pnpm-workspace.yaml pins a
# single esbuild 0.28.2; the vulnerable 0.25.12 (go1.23.12) it replaced is what
# used to be listed here. Seven Go stdlib CVEs are still unfixed at go1.26.5
# and clear on the first esbuild built with Go 1.27. They are deliberately not
# ignored: Trivy cannot read 0.28.2 build info so it reports nothing today, and
# a blanket ignore of stdlib ids would mask them in any other Go binary.
